claim.claim-text:
- providing a solid feedstock comprising a carbonaceous and/or mineral-based material;
- providing a flow of an oxidizing gas, wherein said oxidizing gas comprises carbon dioxide and is not in a supercritical state, wherein the carbon dioxide is derived from industrial processes;
- introducing said solid feedstock and said flow of an oxidizing gas into a mechanical agitation unit,
- subjecting the material of said solid feedstock in the presence of said oxidizing gas to a mechanical agitation operation in said mechanical agitation unit at a pressure of at least 1 atm (15psi).
